%% What a member's votes and answers are worth (_refusal, _witness_state).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoStorage: start(), new incarnation inc
    NoStorage --> Rejoining: attach, log without rejoined marker
    NoStorage --> Witness: attach, marked log loaded, promises restored
    Rejoining --> Witness: rejoin completed (ballot round, R78a)
    Witness --> NoStorage: detach (space closed)
    Rejoining --> NoStorage: detach
    Witness --> TierFailed: acceptor-log or record write failed (R57)
    TierFailed --> NoStorage: detach, then reopen on a healthy disk
    Witness --> Fenced: unexpected exception in a lane thread
    Fenced --> [*]: stop
    Witness --> [*]: stop
    note right of NoStorage
        refuses grants and acceptances (no_storage),
        answers state=unknown, never counted
    end note
    note right of Rejoining
        refuses (rejoining), answers state=empty,
        counted only at a first start (R51)
    end note
    note right of Witness
        grants (not during startup_grace, a liveness rule),
        acknowledges, answers state=ok. A learner never votes (D54).
    end note
